# Stands in for Quickshell.Widgets, whose plugin only the qs binary loads. StyledSlider.qml imports it
# and uses none of its types, so tst_backend_slider.qml needs only the module to resolve. Qt skips a
# module that declares no type, so it declares the stand-in IconImage.
module Quickshell.Widgets
IconImage 1.0 IconImage.qml
